        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>30 Inch Traditional Castle Rope Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large door pull is normally used on entry doors; but it will work great on a grand interior door where a traditionally style large pull is desired. It is Thru-Bolt Mounted for Wood, Fiberglass or Metal doors. The Castle Rope Door Pull is a great example of beauty and elegance. It comes in a trendy Satin Nickel Finish. It is 30 inches overall and has 23-1/4 inch mounting centers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p =\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-833P-detail.jpg?v=1704354615\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"FII-833P-30-US15 Detailed View\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications:</b> of the Satin Nickel Traditional Castle Rope Style Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 23-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Material: Wood, Fiberglass, Metal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounted:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>Only One Left</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
