                "description": "This large door pull is normally used on entry doors; but it will work great on a grand interior door where a traditionally style large pull is desired. It is  Thru-Bolt Mounted for Wood, Fiberglass or Metal doors. The Castle Rope Door Pull is a great example of beauty and elegance. It comes in a trendy Satin Nickel Finish. It is 30 inches overall and has 23-1/4 inch mounting centers.\r\n",
